<span id="S2.T1.4.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:331.2pt;">
<span id="S2.T1.4.9.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.T1.4.9.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">M: manual refinement, R: recall (private), A: accuracy, BA: Balanced accuracy.</span></span>
